# sail train/validate configs are fully reconstructible from
# pipeline_configs/state_registry.yml + generate_train_config.py /
# generate_validate_config.py -- not worth versioning each run (matches
# sail's own configs/ being gitignored). geoetl download configs ARE
# tracked (configs/geoetl/) -- they're a record of what was actually
# downloaded, matching geoetl's own configs/tlags/ convention. Generated
# SLURM job files (both under configs/geoetl/ and configs/sail/) aren't
# tracked either way -- regenerate any time from the config + generator.
configs/sail/
configs/**/*.sh
